# The water cycle
box ocean "Ocean" at 140 420 states calm|warm
box cloud "Cloud" at 460 140 states thin|heavy|storm
box mountain "Mountain" at 800 260 states dry|snowy
box river "River" at 640 520 states low|flowing|flood
arrow evap ocean -> cloud states off|slow|fast "evaporation"
arrow rain cloud -> mountain states off|on "rain"
arrow run mountain -> river states off|on
arrow back river -> ocean states off|on
token drop "droplet" on ocean, cloud, mountain, river, ocean
slider sun "Sunlight" at 140 640 states weak|strong|scorching
bar heat "Evaporation" at 1080 470 values 10|55|92
link sun -> heat, evap
card why "Why does rain fall?" back "Droplets merge until gravity beats the updraft." at 1040 150
step "Sun warms the ocean" ocean=warm sun=1
step "Water vapor rises and condenses" drop=1 cloud=heavy
step "Rain falls on the mountain" drop=2 rain=on mountain=snowy
step "Snowmelt feeds the river" drop=3 run=on river=flowing
step "The river returns to the sea" drop=4 back=on
